  "question": "设 $f(x) = \\begin{cases} e^x, & x < 1 \\\\ x, & x \\geqslant 1 \\end{cases}$ , $\\varphi(x) = \\begin{cases} x + 2, & x < 0 \\\\ x^2 - 1, & x \\geqslant 0 \\end{cases}$ , 求 $f[\\varphi(x)]$ .",
  "answer": "$f[\\varphi(x)]=\\begin{cases}e^{x+2},&x<-1\\\\ x+2,&-1\\le x<0\\\\ e^{x^2-1},&0\\le x<\\sqrt{2}\\\\ x^2-1,&x\\ge\\sqrt{2}\\end{cases}$",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "函数复合",
    "函数方程"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 引入中间变量 $u = \\varphi(x)$ ，由外层函数定义域的各区间段，通过中间变量得到自变量 $x$ 的对应范围，进而确定中间变量的具体表达式，以得到复合函数."
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "记 $u = \\varphi(x)$ , 则 $f[\\varphi(x)] = f(u) = \\begin{cases} \\mathrm{e}^u, & u < 1 \\\\ u, & u \\geqslant 1 \\end{cases}$ ,"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "当 $u < 1$ 时："
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "当 $x < 0$ 时， $u = x + 2 < 1 \\Rightarrow x < -1, f[\\varphi(x)] = e^{x + 2}$ ；"
      },
      {
        "id": "s5",
        "text": "当 $x \\geqslant 0$ 时， $u = x^2 - 1 < 1 \\Rightarrow 0 \\leqslant x < \\sqrt{2}$ ， $f[\\varphi(x)] = \\mathrm{e}^{x^2 - 1}$ ."
      },
      {
        "id": "s6",
        "text": "当 $u \\geqslant 1$ 时："
      },
      {
        "id": "s7",
        "text": "当 $x < 0$ 时， $u = x + 2 \\geqslant 1 \\Rightarrow -1 \\leqslant x < 0, f[\\varphi(x)] = x + 2;$"
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "$f[\\varphi(x)]=\\begin{cases}e^{x+2},&x<-1\\\\ x+2,&-1\\le x<0\\\\ e^{x^2-1},&0\\le x<\\sqrt{2}\\\\ x^2-1,&x\\ge\\sqrt{2}\\end{cases}$",
    "techniques_used": [
      "函数复合",
      "函数方程"
    ]
  },
